# Shared golden vectors for the retirement chain of a type-0x24 outpost: damage (8002AA1C.c), the
# deferred message 4 (8004CE04.c:59-60), the retire (8002A810.c, 8004D958.c), the sweep's message 5
# (8004D598.c:54, 8002D664.c:179-225) and the level reset (8004CCDC.c).
# Verified against unchanged PS1 C via tests/host/outpost-retirement/run.sh (gcc 2.7.2 + qemu-mipsel).
# Setup: 1P, player team 1 at score index 0, drone id 287 on team 2 (timer 500), session +0xE0 = 4.
# Outpost id 113 / runtime 1 (F6 = 1, F7 = 2, flags 0x910149, +0x19 = 0x15, model 31 coord), child
# runtime 2 linked first (flags 0xA10051, model 32 coord), both at the origin; the player stands at
# the origin. Each hit frame adds one projectile (record 12|0x8000, damage word +0x1A, model 44
# coord) at (shotDx, shotDy, 0). Scripts: bit 0 = damage script +0x94, bit 1 = retire script +0x98.
# Inputs : name health damage hits frames fe extraFlags slot desc childHit near shotDy reset scripts targetable shotDx
# Outputs: -> outHealth outAlive outFreed outFlags out8C childHealth childFlags childAlive childFreed
#            score0 score1 total0 total1 p0Count10 stCount38 stTimer18 e0
#            footprints footprintOwners footMask refreshes unitRetired dmgScripts lastDead retScripts lastRetArg
